:: Carter House Entering Pool State [nobr]

/* Intro */
You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> are sitting on two of the patio chairs on the porch in his backyard, just chilling and staring up at the clouds. Your attention turns to the large pool <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> has in his backyard, currently covered by its cover. Sadly, you can’t just strip down and jump in because of said cover, but his family has been pretty alright with opening it for <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> and his friends to swim before, <span style="color:LightGreen">so you take a chance and ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> if he would like to go for a bit of a swim.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sure! That sounds fun. I’ll go see if my dad or brother will get it open. You have something to swim in, right?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> leaps from the chair, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“If you want to go get changed in the bathroom, I’ll meet you out here!”</span> You nod and head to the bathroom. <br>
<br>

