:: Carter House Entering Pool State 2 [nobr]

/* Intro */

<<set _random to random(1, 2)>>
<<if _random == 1>>
    Changed into your swimwear, you walk into the yard to find <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s dad currently opening up the pool. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, hey.”</span> He waves, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Should be done in just a second, think <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s changing. You two have fun.”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">He finishes opening the pool and heads inside, with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> blasting out a moment later and leaping into the pool with a loud battle cry.</span> <br>
<<else>>
    Changed into your swimwear, you walk into the yard to find <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s older brother, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span>, opening up the pool. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Just about done.”</span> He says as he sees you, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Think Ultraboy’s changing. Try not to get too crazy, alright?”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">He laughs as he finishes opening the pool and heads inside. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> blasts out a moment later, leaping into the pool with a loud battle cry.</span> <br>
<</if>>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Swim",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah!”</span> He laughs as he surfaces, spitting out some water that got into his mouth. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Come on in! Water’s great.”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">He gives you a big smile as you jump in next to him, ready to play and relax in the water with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>.</span> <br>
